2. deck.gl (https://github.com/visgl/deck.gl), which draws datamapplot's maps

topic-map.js reproduces deck.gl's drawing of those maps: the Web Mercator world
512 units wide, the zoom step of one wheel event (wheelScale), and the test of
25 pixels around a label's anchor with the label faded by the share it owns,
raised to 2.2 (resolveCollisions, _claimsRead). theme-neutral.js reproduces
deck.gl's zoom durations and tooltip padding.

